sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant ROS as ROS2 Runtime
    participant DC as DataCollector
    participant TP as TransformerPipeline
    participant ED as ExportDispatcher
    participant EXP as Exporter Layer
    participant CV as DataConverter
    participant VS as VerdictService

    Note over ROS,DC: Observation stage
    ROS-->>DC: raw message (monitored entity)
    DC->>DC: wrap as DataRecord
    DC->>TP: process(record)
    TP-->>DC: filtered DataRecord

    Note over DC,CV: Transport stage 
    DC->>ED: dispatch(record)
    ED->>EXP: export(record)
    EXP->>CV: deliver(record)

    Note over CV,VS: Evaluation stage
    CV->>CV: convert to DSL-ready record
    CV->>ED: dispatch(dsl_record)
    ED->>EXP: export(dsl_record)
    EXP->>VS: deliver(dsl_record)
    VS->>VS: evaluate against property
    VS-->>VS: emit Verdict
